  "title": "Mashle: Magic and Muscles",
  "description": "This is a world of magic where magic is used for everything. But deep in the forest exists a young man who spends his time training and bulking up. He can't use magic, but he enjoys a peaceful life with his father. But one day, his life is put in danger! Will his muscular body protect him from the magic users who are out to get him? Powerfully trained muscles crush magic as this abnormal magical fantasy begins! \n\n(Source: MANGA Plus) \n\n*Note:\n\\- Eleventh place of Tsugimanga 2020 Award in the Manga Category.*\n\nStatus: completed\nTags: Absurdity, Action, Arrogant Male Lead, Arrogant Protagonist, Badass Male Lead, Bickering Friendship, Black-Haired Male Lead, Black-Haired Protagonist, Comedic Undertone, Comedic Violence, Comedy, Discrimination, Expressionless Male Lead, Fantasy, Gourmet, Innocent Male Lead, Magic Items, Muscular Male Lead, Muscular Protagonist, Overpowered Male Lead, Primarily Male Cast, Primarily Teen Cast, Quiet Male Lead, Romantic Subplot, Sarcastic Male Lead, School, School Life, Slapstick, Special Ability, Stoic Male Lead, Straightforward Female Lead, Straightforward Male Lead, Strong Character, Sweet Tooth, Teenagers, Unrealistic Fighting, Unrequited Love, Young Male Lead, Adapted to Anime, Adapted to Stage Play, Adopted Protagonist, Adoption, Aromantic, Arrogant Characters, Asexual, Badass Protagonist, Comedic Facial Expressions, Cooking, Expressionless Protagonist, Fights, Fitness, Funny Male Lead, Gag Humor, Gods, Handsome Male Character, Handsome Male Lead, Hardboiled, Kind Protagonist, LGBTQ+, Magic, Magic School, Male Lead, Male Protagonist, Mean Male Lead, Muscles, Overpowered Protagonist, Parodic Elements, Parody, Protagonist Strong from the Start, Quirky Character, Rude Male Lead, Rude Protagonist, Saving the World, Self Proclaimed Bride, Shounen, Sister Complex, Snarky Character, Snarky Male Lead, Stoic Protagonist, Strong Male Lead, Strong Protagonist, Surreal Comedy, Surrealism, Training, Underestimated Male 